; PARSE-9: hledger's bracket posting-date shorthand, in all three spellings.
; The brackets stay in the comment text and produce no tag.
2024-01-01 t
    a   $1.00  ; [2024-01-05]
    b  $-1.00  ; [=2024-01-06]

2024-01-01 u
